{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לַמְנַצֵּחַ לִבְנֵי־קֹרַח מִזְמוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כָּל־הָעַמִּים תִּקְעוּ־כָף הָרִיעוּ לֵאלֹהִים בְּקוֹל רִנָּה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" עֶלְיוֹן נוֹרָא מֶלֶךְ גָּדוֹל עַל־כָּל־הָאָרֶץ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יַדְבֵּר עַמִּים תַּחְתֵּינוּ וּלְאֻמִּים תַּחַת רַגְלֵינוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִבְחַר־לָנוּ אֶת־נַחֲלָתֵנוּ אֶת גְּאוֹן יַעֲקֹב "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n187.jpg","n":"83"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"אֲשֶׁר־אָהֵב סֶלָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עָלָה אֱלֹהִים בִּתְרוּעָה "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּקוֹל שׁוֹפָר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זַמְּרוּ אֱלֹהִים זַמֵּרוּ זַמְּרוּ לְמַלְכֵּנוּ זַמֵּרוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי מֶלֶךְ כָּל־הָאָרֶץ אֱלֹהִים זַמְּרוּ מַשְׂכִּיל: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מָלַךְ אֱלֹהִים עַל־גּוֹיִם אֱלֹהִים יָשַׁב עַל־כִּסֵּא קָדְשׁוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"נְדִיבֵי עַמִּים נֶאֱסָפוּ עַם אֱלֹהֵי אַבְרָהָם כִּי לֵאלֹהִים מָגִנֵּי־אֶרֶץ מְאֹד נַעֲלָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
